OL,3,A'No jobs on a dead planet' - former
OL,4,Acommissioner defends helping scrap M4
OL,5,Arelief road
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former independent commissioner says
OL,8,Fshe helped scrap the M4 relief road
OL,9,Fover concerns about the environment
OL,10,Fbecause "there are no jobs on a dead
OL,11,Fplanet".
OL,13,FSophie Howe made the comment on a BBC
OL,14,Fpodcast after it was suggested the
OL,15,Fcancelled 14-mile (22km) motorway in
OL,16,FNewport could have helped boost the
OL,17,Feconomy.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
