OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'No jobs on a dead planet' - former
OL,4,Acommissioner defends helping scrap M4
OL,5,Arelief road
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowe, who was the world's first future
OL,8,Fgenerations commissioner, described
OL,9,Fhelping get dozens of other road
OL,10,Fprojects cancelled including a third
OL,11,FMenai crossing over concerns about the
OL,12,Fenvironment and wellbeing.
OL,14,FThe Welsh government said it was
OL,15,Freviewing options for the M4 around
OL,16,FNewport after the previous Labour
OL,17,Fgovernment under Mark Drakeford
OL,18,Fscrapped plans for a relief road in
OL,19,F2019.
